I come out of the office.
I go to the bus stop.
The evening weather is very nice.
My regular red bus arrives.
I board the bus.
There is not much crowd in the bus at this time.
I give twenty rupees to the conductor bhaiya.
I take my ticket from him.
I get a window seat.
I sit there.
I put my bag on my lap.
The bus moves forward.
Outside, the city lights look very beautiful.
A cool breeze comes through the open window.
I feel very relaxed.
I look out of the window onto the road.
Many cars pass by the bus.
People also go back to their homes.
My daily journey is very peaceful.
Soon my stop arrives.
